     "text": "```python\nclass Playlist:\n    \"\"\"\n    A class to represent a playlist, allowing the addition and removal of songs.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        \"\"\"\n        Initialize an empty playlist.\n        \"\"\"\n        self._songs = []\n\n    def add_song(self, song):\n        \"\"\"\n        Add a song to the playlist.\n\n        Parameters:\n        song (str): The name of the song to add.\n\n        Returns:\n        bool: True if the song was added successfully, False if the song already exists.\n        \"\"\"\n        if song in self._songs:\n            return False\n        self._songs.append(song)\n        return True\n\n    def remove_song(self, song):\n        \"\"\"\n        Remove a song from the playlist.\n\n        Parameters:\n        song (str): The name of the song to remove.\n\n        Returns:\n        bool: True if the song was removed successfully, False if the song does not exist.\n        \"\"\"\n        if song not in self._songs:\n            return False\n        self._songs.remove(song)\n        return True\n```",
